","ucode":"E75189846F6616","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/82/54/b9cd3674.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1747880361,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100060601,"comment_content":"能看到这里的都不容易啊","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":398376,"user_name":"冷笑浅兮","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1324854,"ip_address":"贵州","ucode":"C7AF1B8616667A","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/14/37/36/70e2077b.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1741145087,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100060601,"comment_content":"老师，我想请教一个问题，这个问题让我很困惑。问题是这样的：\n我在使用 axum 和 axum_valid 以及 validator 这三个库来现实一个自己的 ValidJson 类型的 Extractor，这样就可以在提取 json 的同时也把校验的事做了。在方法的实现中写了：let result = axum_valid::Valid::&lt;Json&lt;T&gt;&gt;::from_request(req, state).await;\n此时 result 的类型编译器给出的提示是：Result&lt;Valid&lt;Json&lt;T&gt;&gt;, &lt;Valid&lt;Json&lt;T&gt;&gt; as FromRequest&lt;State, ViaRequest&gt;&gt;::Rejection&gt;。\n在 valid 库内部，Valid 类型也是通过实现 FromRequest 特质的（这是 axum 框架中提供的 trait 用于请求数据的提取的），这个特质有一个关联类型的 Rejection，在 Valid 类型的 FromRequest 具体实现中将 Rejection 定义为了 ValidationRejection&lt;ValidationErrors, E&gt;，它是一个有两个变体的枚举，意思就是一个变体保存 validator 库验证时出现的错误，另一个变体保存嵌套在 Valid 里面的那个 Extractor（在这里是 Json&lt;T&gt;）出现的错误（类型就是 Json 实现 FromRequest 时指定的那个 Rejection 关联类型，在这里实际上是 ApiError 类型，因为这里的 Json 类型是我自定义的类型（只是名字起的跟 axum 提供的一模一样），这样做是为了可以自定义因为解析 json 出现的错误，从而可以返回自定义的友好响应信息）。\n\n这里我要处理这个 result，Ok 的情况很好说，就是 Err 的情况很棘手，因为我期望 Err 中的那个 err 值类型是 ValidationRejection&lt;ValidationErrors, ApiError&gt;（实际情况其实也是这个类型），但是编译时它是 &lt;Valid&lt;Json&lt;T&gt;&gt; as FromRequest&lt;State, ViaRequest&gt;&gt;::Rejection，我没办法做判断，因为这个类型很虚，啥方法也没有（写代码的时候编译器只会知道它是 &lt;Valid&lt;Json&lt;T&gt;&gt; as FromRequest&lt;State, ViaRequest&gt;&gt;::Rejection，就很难受），我也没有办法强转，强转就会报类型不匹配的错，很无奈，只能上这种大法（这里 err 是我搞的对 err 值的一个引用）：\nlet ptr = err as *const _ as *const u8 as *const ValidationRejection&lt;ValidationErrors, ApiError&gt;;\n    unsafe { &amp;*ptr }\n这样做是没问题的，可以编译，运行时也没有报错，一切正常，但是就是不优雅，而且引入了不安全的代码，总觉得蹩脚，所以就想请教一下您，看看有什么更好的解决方案吗？非常感谢","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":351441,"user_name":"菌临天下","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2189067,"ip_address":"","ucode":"F49E70D579D59E","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/21/67/0b/6ba9e8bb.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1657788980,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100060601,"comment_content":"在此表达感谢，其实还没刷完，进度过半，先赞后看~","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":314994,"user_name":"newzai","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1102367,"ip_address":"","ucode":"D5E34D427D65FD","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/d2/1f/2ef2514b.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1633651739,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100060601,"comment_content":"咨询个问题  昨天写代码不小心写个了死递归，导致stack溢出了，崩溃是只打印一行提示，没有详细的调用stack信息，如何像go一样，崩溃有stack信息呢？","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":314879,"user_name":"newzai","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1102367,"ip_address":"","ucode":"D5E34D427D65FD","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/d2/1f/2ef2514b.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1633524662,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100060601,"comment_content":"居然是第一位刷完课程的","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":314744,"user_name":"手机失联户","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1258691,"ip_address":"","ucode":"876DC3D73F8E3A","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/34/c3/ed5881c6.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1633396369,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100060601,"comment_content":"老师辛苦了！","like_count":0}]}